{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>西貢有人墮海。據了解，今日（15日）凌晨2時42分，一名年約40歲男子在滘西洲對面海面載浮載沉，另一名男子駕駛舢舨見狀救人，將事主帶到早禾坑碼頭和報案。事主昏迷由救護車送往將軍澳醫院進行搶救，延至同日凌晨3時49分宣告不治，警方正調查事件。</p><figure><img alt=\"警方在將軍澳醫院調查。（陳永武攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261015/1187267020828315648184963.jpeg/iyyaPP_jVa7O9UIw_jEg7QomX4HUfCxhAm7K1DhuytQ\"/><figcaption>警方在將軍澳醫院調查。（陳永武攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警方在將軍澳醫院調查。（陳永武攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261015/1187267017158168576381429.jpeg/h_fe8C0Klx0Y9lN1CCL1zgrY0uxZWvyRXp6tNmSerTY\"/><figcaption>警方在將軍澳醫院調查。（陳永武攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"事主昏迷由救護車送往將軍澳醫院進行搶救，最終不治。（陳永武攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261015/1187267024435548160853970.jpeg/QFk5NFNdjiCPNAuJwcD-A82Wbltu4ZFlVqPysWyj8rE\"/><figcaption>事主昏迷由救護車送往將軍澳醫院進行搶救，最終不治。（陳永武攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T07:47:38.482417+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":188,"images":3,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-14T21:03:12+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T07:56:45.979592+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T07:41:14.198933+00:00","content_hash":"3d9371bb810ebc005d34d139adc6c5e95b8e1b6bcb1828f60e656c78599064d1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}